   "title": "Ghana urged to adopt rapid cancer diagnostic technology to cut delays in treatments",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/ghana-urged-to-adopt-rapid-cancer-diagnostic-technology-to-cut-delays-in-treatments/",
