   "title": "Bangladesh opposition leader warns against India corridor, seeks fair Ganges water pact: Reports",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/bangladesh-opposition-leader-warns-against-india-corridor-seeks-fair-ganges-water-pact-reports/article71650427.ece",
