   "_dt": 1793405061.0,
   "ageDays": 0.74,
   "summary": "The Olugbo of Ugboland, Oba Fredrick Akinruntan, has appealed to the Federal Government to clean up communities in Ondo State affected by water pollution. Read More: https://punchng.com/air-crash-ondo-monarch-raises-the-alarm-over-water-pollution/",
   "summary_zh": "乌博兰地区的Olugbo统治者Oba Fredrick Akinruntan呼吁联邦政府整治奥恩多州受水污染影响的社区。阅读更多：https://punchng.com/air-crash-ondo-monarch-raises-the-alarm-over-water-pollution/",
