   "title": "Trade minister seeks input from tourism, media firms as Seoul pushes to widen China FTA",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/20261030/trade-minister-seeks-input-from-tourism-media-firms-as-seoul-pushes-to-widen-china-fta",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
