   "title": "Zamfara First Lady Supports 150 Women Farmers With Inputs, Cash",
   "url": "https://dailytrust.com/zamfara-first-lady-supports-150-women-farmers-with-inputs-cash/",
   "domain": "dailytrust.com",
   "source": "Daily Trust（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:57:07 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793296627.0,
   "ageDays": 2.0,
   "summary": "The Zamfara State First Lady, Hajiya Hurriya Dauda Lawal, has provided farm inputs and financial assistance to more than 150 women farmers to boost agricultural production and food security. The support was announced during the 2026 World Food Day celebration organised by the Nigerian Women for Agriculture Progressive Development Initiative (NWAPDI) at the Ministry of […]",
   "summary_zh": "扎姆法拉州第一夫人哈吉娅·胡里亚·达乌达·拉瓦勒向150多名女性农民提供了农用物资和财政援助，以促进农业生产和粮食安全。尼日利亚妇女农业渐进发展倡议（NWAPDI）组织的2026年世界粮食日庆祝活动上宣布了这一援助。仪式在[…]举行。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "The Zamfara State First Lady, Hajiya Hurriya Dauda Lawal, has provided farm inputs and financial assistance to more than 150 women farmers to boost agricultural production and food security. The support was announced during the 2026 World Food Day celebration organised by the Nigerian Women for Agriculture Progressive Development Initiative (NWAPDI) at the Ministry of […]",
