   "title": "S. Korea, US, partners reaffirm N. Korea denuclearization goal, back sanctions enforcement",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261029/s-korea-us-partners-reaffirm-n-korea-denuclearization-goal-back-sanctions-enforcement",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
