   "snippet": "Reminder that China and India both have agreed to occupy Nepal's territory to India and do trade with each other without informing or with approval of Nepal. \nThis will only push us towards the arms of Americans and create anti-China sentiment in our country. And US will use this opportunity to use our land against you. \nChina should be aware. \ncc @PRCAmbNepal",
